{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a34af99b-a6f0-41f6-a01f-59a0010d25cc",
    "name": "Task Manager API",
    "description": "Postman collection for Task Manager API Version 2.\n\nRun the requests in order from 01 to 12.  \nThe collection automatically stores userId, projectId, taskId, and userEmail.\n\nThe collection demonstrates the main API flow:\n\n1. Create a user — 201 Created\n    \n2. Create a project — 201 Created\n    \n3. Create a task assigned to the user and project — 201 Created\n    \n4. Get all tasks — 200 OK\n    \n5. Get the created task by ID — 200 OK\n    \n6. Update the task — 200 OK\n    \n7. Verify the updated task — 200 OK\n    \n8. Delete the task — 204 No Content\n    \n9. Verify that the deleted task returns 404 Not Found\n    \n10. Verify validation error for invalid user email — 400 Bad Request\n    \n11. Verify Task Not Found response — 404 Not Found\n    \n12. Verify duplicate user email conflict — 409 Conflict",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "56491373",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/56491373-a34af99b-a6f0-41f6-a01f-59a0010d25cc?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Create User",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {\r",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);\r",
              "});\r",
              "\r",
              "if (pm.response.code === 201) {\r",
              "    const responseData = pm.response.json();\r",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userId\", responseData.id);\r",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "// Generate a unique test email to avoid duplicate-email conflicts.\r",
              "const uniqueEmail = `jakub.kowalski.${Date.now()}@example.com`;\r",
              "\r",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userEmail\", uniqueEmail);"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {}
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\r\n  \"name\": \"Jakub\",\r\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\"\r\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "users"
          ]
        }
      },
